==Official Introduction==
> Augusta is the undefeated gladiator in the arena and a fearless leader with a will of iron.
She is a mere mortal, but has reached heights of glory attempted by only a few, and her blade speaks her power loud and clear.
> — Description from the [https://wutheringwaves.kurogames.com/m/en/main/#resonators Official Website]

== Personality ==
An undefeated warrior in battle, Augusta is fearless; this trait makes her a worthy leader of her people. Although an ordinary human, Augusta shows that she can rise to great power through dedication and strength.  

== Appearance ==
Augusta is a tall, striking woman with a lean, slender, but fit build and pale, clear skin. She has sharp, narrow eyes of an intense red hue with a white-gold ring surrounding her red pupils. She has long, vibrant and wavy orange-red hair that cascades past her shoulders down to her waist. 

Her [[Tacet Mark]] is located on the back of her left hand. 

===Clothing===
Augusta wears a flowing white high-necked, sleeveless tunic-like top with golden accents in the style of wreaths. Over her top is a golden metallic chestplate with intricate detailing in a darker gold. A pair of metal pauldrons rest on both of her shoulders and connect to a black and golden high-necked choker. The lower part of Augusta's outfit is a white flowing skirt of the same design as her top along with silver armor plating but has three long pterugues strips of brown leather decorated with three gold disks. Underneath her skirt, Augusta has on a pair of thick black high cut shorts. For footwear, Augusta wears white high-heeled sandals accented with brown leather straps, and two metal platings over each of her shins. To accent her outfit, Augusta sports a golden piece of headwear shaped like a sunburst that rests on her brow and a pair of golden dangle earrings shaped as eight-pointed stars. Two leather brownvambraces with metallic platings cover both her foreams and she wears a black ring on each thumb.

